17:["$","p",null,{"children":["Three things are legal here that plain JSON rejects: ",["$","code",null,{"children":"//"}]," and ",["$","code",null,{"children":"/* */"}],"\ncomments, unquoted object keys, and trailing commas. Nearly every shipped\nexample in ",["$","code",null,{"children":"forge-config/examples/"}]," uses all three, so a strict-JSON tool\npointed at one of them will report syntax errors that aren't real."]}]
