28:["$","p",null,{"children":["That has one practical consequence worth internalising: ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"a container image\ndoes not carry its config"}],". Every deployment recipe in this repo mounts a\nconfig file in and passes its path as the argument. If you're writing a\nKubernetes manifest, the config is a ConfigMap you mount, not something baked\ninto the image."]}]
